DESCRIPTION:Sale is Friday and Saturday - don't wait for the lower prices 
 on Saturday. It is all priced to sell!\nOn Sunday\, it will be $40 to ent
 er and take what ever you want.\n\nDo your Holiday shopping here! These o
 wners (both doctors) were here for over 30 years\, and there are some vin
 tage things in the basement\, but it's mostly brand new items that interi
 or designers bought to decorate the home. The main floor was re-decorated
  every couple of years all of the previous decorations were stored. We're
  talking about over 5000 sq ft of gorgeous items and EVERYTHING is being 
 sold. I am pricing it to move on day 1.\nAs the owner took me around\, sh
 e showed me everything from her :"shabby chic" era and her "asian" era an
 d her "MCM" era etc etc.\nThere will be lots of mens suits\, he is fit\, 
 so prob med/large with his clothing and quite a bit of women's clothing a
 lso on the small-med size. TONS of designer bags and shoes. They have 2 (
 adult) daughters so clothes for younger women as well. M-XL\nThey are goi
 ng to FL so come and get your winter clothes. Mens shoes all sizes NIKES 
