 large furniture items\, if you see something you want contact me. if some
 thing sells I will take the picture down. The dining room set is incredib
 le. and there are some very expensive (selling for much less) unique furn
 iture items.+++\nI have SO SO SO many more pictures that will be posted i
 n the next few days and because set up will take a week or more\, I will 
 post as I put items out. Please email or text me with questions or call m
 e if you want to purchase something.\nThis is my last estate sale of the 
